{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "五十"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "五十一"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "五十二"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "五十三"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "五十四"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "五十五"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "五十六"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "五十七"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "五十八"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "嗚呼！此真淨土中人也。世之泛泛念佛者，可以愧死。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "梅君成瓚室"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "年四十七，光緒三年卒。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "香國赴杭州經局，母死，未及奔喪。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "使長女性滿，依海天\n精舍修行，以了生死。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "其卒時，姪女慧香適至，念佛人不約而同\n者甚多，羣以為異。及母之二十七箇月喪服滿日，玉尺適至其家，遂為說冥戒，此更非思議所能到。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "常熟"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "平時習氣如此，文人自古往往以此而誤事業，況修行乎"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此心地純善，境界平和，或眷屬所熏，或前生善\n\n根當熟，往徃有臨終反勝於平時者，然未可以為例"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "儀徵"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "江都"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "如皋"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "臨死特以數珠挂頸，手持之。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "泰州"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "鏡影鐘聲內另有傳。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "常熟"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "常熟"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "如皋"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "常熟"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "常熟"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "復有自題\n所書水陸通論二截句，見鏡影鐘聲。同治辛未寄玉尺一首云：大體從來未易原，含靈曲折況難言。心如明鏡\n涵燈影，地角天涯總不暄。亦可見其用心之苦矣。若海天之真子哀詞，萬玉哀鳴，有心人不能卒讀。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "無錫"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "并序"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "常熟"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "常熟"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "代玉尺作"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "如皋"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "空謂天空。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "江都"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一卷之書，名曰虗空樓閣。然屢屢刪增，不滯舊\n說也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "修一\n兄李漢卿，淨土亦切"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "女幼失母，為周氏養媳，卒於戊寅夏。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "母卒數年耳"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "寧波"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "亡，養媳李月善，母王氏，攜此女屬蓮慧之妻曰：為君媳，我無憾矣。遂育於周。於經呪，喜誦習，不精世務。謂\n姑曰：大人何懇切於日用若此？光緒四年，年二十，夏五月，先吾母而卒。吾師玉尺閔之，為說冥戒定法，名\n曰好音。嗚呼！殆將西歸也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "石麟曰：此未與玉尺一面者也。次年春，玉尺為印所設經堂，則又為童女之可造者也。凝秀有神，曾一見\n玉尺，欲求開示而未及，同堪惋惜者歟！"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "海天精舍，一名放生菴。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "又如一字頂，輪王應念而現七寶，其男女\n蠢靈，非實非虛，純乎聖凡，然化中亦一一有因也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二合"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "終"}
